GhidraAmace

This extension implements ideas described in "Analyzing Bytes: Pre-Disassembly
Static Binary Analysis" by Huan Nguyen, Soumyakant Priyadarshan, ChenCheng Jiang,
and R. Sekar (PACMPL / PLDI 2026), https://doi.org/10.1145/3808292 .
The Java implementation and Listing projection policy are independently written.
The original AMACE research backend and its learned lifter are not included.

Superset disassembly was described by Erik Bauman, Zhiqiang Lin, and Kevin Hamlen,
"Superset Disassembly: Statically Rewriting x86 Binaries Without Heuristics"
(NDSS 2018).

Ghidra is a separate dependency distributed by the National Security Agency.

